entical** between the C and Rust libraries; both exit 0.\n- The **debug** build (overflow checks on) is also byte-identical, confirming no arithmetic panics where C silently wraps.\n\nFiles written: `translation/Cargo.toml` (`crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`) and `translation/src/lib.rs`. Nothing in `c_src/` was modified, and the temporary test scaffolding was removed.","ttft_ms":4294,"ttft_stream_ms":4085,"time_to_request_ms":44,"type":"result","duration_ms":834031,"uuid":"baadbb97-f7f8-4b32-96b4-89f3d1577942","queued_turn_count":0}
